## invariant `completed_implies_timestamp` — Completed Tasks Have a Timestamp

`invariants/task.spec:9`

**guarantee**

> A task with status `done` MUST have a non-null completedAt timestamp.
> A task that is not `done` MUST NOT have a completedAt timestamp.

**Fields**

| Field | Value |
|---|---|
| risk | low |

**Referenced by**

| Field | Entity | Kind | Title |
|---|---|---|---|
| invariants | `complete_task` | behavior | Complete a Task |

**Verify**

| # | Kind | Obligation |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | unit | completing a task sets completedAt |
| 2 | unit | reopening a task clears completedAt |

